      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The wanderer tosses a bead formed from an element of its choice. <em>Ranged Weapon Attack:</em> +7, range 40/120 ft. <em>Hit:</em> The target suffers one of the following effects:</p><ul><li><strong>Air.</strong> 9 (2d8) Lightning damage and each creature within 10 feet of the target takes 2 (1d4) Thunder damage.</li><li><strong>Earth.</strong> 11 (2d10) Bludgeoning damage and the target is knocked Prone.</li><li><strong>Fire.</strong> 10 (3d6) Fire damage and the target starts Burning.</li><li><strong>Water.</strong> 11 (2d10) Bludgeoning damage and the target is pushed 15 feet away from the wanderer.</li></ul>",
          "chat": ""
        },
