      "name": "Fusion Blast (Only While Bloodied)",
      "img": "icons/skills/melee/strike-weapons-orange.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "sort": 500,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {},
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The wanderer chooses two elemental beads to fuse together in a blast of energy. <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 15 Constitution, each creature in a 30-foot Emanation centered on the wanderer. The creatures all suffer one of the following effects of the wanderer's choice:</p><ul><li><strong>Ice.</strong> <em>Failure:</em> 18 (4d8) Cold damage and the creature is Restrained by ice until the end of its next turn. <em>Success:</em> Half damage only.</li><li><strong>Magma.</strong> <em>Failure:</em> 17 (5d6) Fire damage. <em>Success:</em> Half damage. <em>Failure or Success:</em> Until the start of the wanderer's next turn, the creature takes 1 Fire damage for every 5 feet it moves within the area.</li><li><strong>Mud.</strong> <em>Failure:</em> 22 (4d10) Bludgeoning damage. <em>Success:</em> Half damage. <em>Failure or Success:</em> The area becomes Difficult Terrain until cleared.</li><li><strong>Smoke.</strong> <em>Failure:</em> 17 (5d6) Fire damage and the creature is Blinded until the end of its next turn. <em>Success:</em> Half damage only.</li></ul>",
          "chat": ""
        },
